BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:state-sales-indiana-q1-2025-04-21@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T122623Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250421
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250422
SUMMARY:Indiana: State sales & use tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Sales tax returns are due the 30th day of the month following t
 he reporting period\, unless the average monthly tax due for the preceding 
 year exceeds $1\,000\, in which case returns are due the 20th day of the mo
 nth following the reporting period. These entries use the 20th-day (larger 
 filer) rule. | Sales tax returns are due the 30th day of the month followin
 g the reporting period\, unless the average monthly tax due for the precedi
 ng year exceeds $1\,000\, in which case returns are due the 20th day of the
  month following the reporting period. These entries use the 20th-day (larg
 er filer) rule. This is a representative recurring pattern\, not a single a
 nnual deadline. | Authority: Direct fetch of Indiana DOR's General Tax Info
 rmation Bulletin (GB-102) this session. | Source: https://secure.in.gov/dor
 /files/gb102.pdf | This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not
  reflect a later-announced change\; confirm against the cited source before
  relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
